  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Qi Jue grotto-heaven, Xiao He Jian warns of an immemorial qi monster created from hard qi: a pitch-black whale-like body, sleeping at that moment. Dragon Palace crashes through it until the monster breaks apart into lumps of black hard qi. Wu Shuai stores the hard qi in the palace and keeps most of the gains while sharing the rest as spoils.",
